{"name":"Plain dress","deep":true,"image":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4c/Plain_traditional_dress.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","credit":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Plain_traditional_dress.jpg","caption":"Plain traditional dress","source":"Wikimedia Commons"},"mentions":0,"casual":{"lead":["Plain dress is clothing of modest design, sturdy fabric and conservative cut worn by groups such as the Amish, Mennonites, Hutterites, Brethren and Quakers. Garments are typically undecorated, in muted colours, and carry no logos.","As a look, it is minimal and uniform. Members describe it as signalling humility, identity and separation from fashion trends."],"sections":[{"h":"How people use it","paras":["Women often wear cape dresses with long skirts and head coverings; men wear dark trousers with suspenders and plain shirts, sometimes broad-brimmed hats. Many garments are handmade."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Risks & side effects","paras":["There are no physical risks. Plain clothing can be hard to find in mainstream shops."],"subs":[]}]},"gallery":[{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4c/Plain_traditional_dress.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","full":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4c/Plain_traditional_dress.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","title":"Plain traditional dress","license":"CC0","creator":"Jeremyida002","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Plain_traditional_dress.jpg","source":"Wikimedia Commons"},{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/35/Sarah_Platt_is_wearing_a_plain_dress_-_DPLA_-_20d7058ec2c5fb6c06c5611518ba945f_%28page_2%29.jpg/960px-Sarah_Platt_is_wearing_a_plain_dress_-_DPLA_-_20d7058ec2c5fb6c06c5611518ba945f_%28page_2%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_conte