e":"Becoming Canis dirus - SvenG's Training Log","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/becoming-canis-dirus-svengs-training-log/273583","site":"T Nation · 6794 posts · 2021"},{"title":"The Tactical Life","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/the-tactical-life/232312","site":"T Nation · 5251 posts · 2017"},{"title":"Dodgin’ Dadbods: Fortitude Training","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/dodgin-dadbods-fortitude-training/240588","site":"T Nation · 4913 posts · 2018"},{"title":"Shane's Over 35 Shenanigans","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/shanes-over-35-shenanigans/279965","site":"T Nation · 4541 posts · 2022"},{"title":"Boilerman Wants It All","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/boilerman-wants-it-all/254882","site":"T Nation · 4422 posts · 2019"},{"title":"Atlas13 Burning the Boats","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/atlas13-burning-the-boats/259312","site":"T Nation · 3716 posts · 2019"},{"title":"Enter Planet Cybertron","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/enter-planet-cybertron/220550","site":"T Nation · 2683 posts · 2016"},{"title":"Wisey's Training Log - StrongEveryDay","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/wiseys-training-log-strongeveryday/276826","site":"T Nation · 2457 posts · 2022"},{"title":"The Israel War Thread","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/the-israel-war-thread/285416","site":"T Nation · 1821 posts · 2023"},{"title":"(Un)Official 2023 T-ransformation Challenge","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/un-official-2023-t-ransformation-challenge/280304","site":"T Nation · 1682 posts · 2022"},{"title":"No Promises This Time","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/no-promises-this-time/268158","site":"T Nation · 1527 posts · 2020"}],"news":[],"social":[],"web":[{"title":"Plain dress — Grokipedia","url":"https://grokipedia.com/page/Plain_dress"},{"title":"Plain dress - Wikipedia","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Plain_dress"}]},"angle":{"goal":"Style & presentation","chain":["Muted solid colours and simple cuts","Uniform, ornament-free look","Modest, neat presentation"],"effect":"direct","text":"The look is built on solid dark or neutral colours, straight cuts and no ornament, which gives a modest, tidy appearance."},"wikipedia":null,"grokipedia":"https://grokipedia.com/page/Plain_dress","lead":["Plain dress is a practice among some religious groups, mainly Christian churches, of wearing modest clothing in sturdy fabric and conservative cut. It signals modesty, traditional gender roles, readiness for work, and communal identity, and keeps members apart from changing fashion [1].","Groups include Amish, Mennonites, Hutterites and Brethren, Conservative Quakers, and holiness Methodists, among others [1]. Garments are usually handmade, undecorated and free of trademarks, and the practice can extend to hair and beards [1]. As an appearance approach it is a minimal, uniform aesthetic."],"infobox":[["Type","Religious dress code"],["Groups","Amish, Mennonites, Hutterites, Brethren, Quakers [1]"],["Women","Cape dress, headcovering, apron [1]"],["Men","Plain trousers, suspenders, dark fabrics [1]"]],"sections":[{"h":"Description","paras":["Women's garments include a long-sleeved, long-skirted cape dress and a kapp or veil based on 1 Corinthians 11; men's include trousers with suspenders, no neckties, and fabrics in black, white, grey and brown, with broad-brimmed hats among Quakers [1]."],"subs":[]},{"h":"History and reasons","paras":["Early Quaker leader George Fox urged plain fashions; John Wesley's sermon 'On Dress' gave guidance to Methodists [1]. Theological reasons cite passages on modesty; sociological reasons include community identity and protection from attention, with Elizabeth Fry calling plain dress 'a hedge against the world' [1]. Variations are governed by community rules called ordnung [1]."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Clinical studies","paras":["No studies found."],"subs":[]}],"lore":null,"timeline":[{"year":"1815","event":"American Moravian women adopt English bonnets [1]"},{"year":"1919","event":"Otho Winger defends plain dress in a Brethren history [1]"}],"refs":[{"title":"Plain dress","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Plain_dress","source":"Wikipedia","year":2025,"type":"encyclopedia"},{"title":"Plain dress","url":"https://grokipedia.com/page/Plain_dress","source":"Grokipedia","year":2025,"type":"encyclopedia"}],"studies":[],"reddit":[],"forums":[{"title":"Anna's Training Log Part 2 (Part 1)","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/annas-training-log-part-2-part-1/258235","site":"T Nation · 9999 posts · 2019"},{"title":"The Stupid Thread 2 (Part 1)","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/the-stupid-thread-2-part-1/219703","site":"T Nation · 9999 posts · 2016"},{"title":"More Trouble Than I Am Worth: Chaos Is The Plan (T3hPwnisher Log)","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/more-trouble-than-i-am-worth-chaos-is-the-plan-t3hpwnisher-log/276232","site":"T Nation · 8677 posts · 2021"},{"title":"Things That Piss You Off","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/things-that-piss-you-off/163775","site":"T Nation · 7426 posts · 2011"},{"title":"Becoming Canis dirus - SvenG's Training Log","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/becoming-canis-dirus-svengs-training-log/273583","site":"T Nation · 6794 posts · 2021"},{"title":"The Tactical Life","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/the-tactical-life/232312","site":"T Nation · 5251 posts · 2017"}]}